},{"title":[["t","中油推動高雄新四輕市府：嚴格把關、落實淨零| 地方"]],"link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE8zVGdUbUlOM2VUQ1FvTWtxVnVia2MwWXhWcnVKR3JhaDd0SmFUMy1UYlBSdnBCZ2ZaOGw5NzRrOUJWeXZobE45ZVZaMHNWV3F4U3JjMDJ1eGJ3bEVSZk5N?oc=5","source":"中央社 CNA","date":"2026-09-07","dupes":1}]},{"topic":"AI / 企業應用","label":"AI","state":"ok","note":"","gist":"AI Agent自主行動、企業零信任治理、供應鏈資安風險","sections":[{"heading":"政策與法規","paras":[[["t","國際組織與資安機構近期頻頻對 AI 自主化與應用邊界提出風險警示。OECD 最新教育評估報告指出，過度依賴 AI 聊天機器人可能削弱學生的獨立理解與批判思考能力，導致測驗表現落後 "],["c",7,"https://technews.tw/2026/09/09/ai-use-in-classrooms-linked-to-lower-test-scores-oecd-data-suggests/"],["t","；這項發現也反映出企業內部若無控管地導入生成式工具，可能面臨員工專業判斷力退化的隱憂。同時，Google 威脅情報小組發布資安報告示警，惡意組織已將大型語言模型深植於入侵生命週期，甚至利用代理式 AI 自主執行滲透測試與攻擊任務，新興的 AI 軟體供應鏈與編碼助理已成為駭客竊取智慧財產的重點目標 "],["c",8,"https://www.cna.com.tw/news/ait/202609090090.aspx"],["c",21,"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFB0NVB6aXIxTzEyWXRuZlhPeXdmMmtJRjJqVlpyc2ZIUDR0b3hBbjZTVmVwSUNjbjF5Um85OUhROGRybmc0UFJPdXdweG90Zzkw0gFWQVVfeXFMTUZNS2hPU0ZmMjVuVjgwS1dfd3dFWUtRQS13WFBYREtuVUljWWNjSWwyUWpEWlg2eloxb3JETFpBdHRzMHlQblF4WlRxY2NXbTJJaUIxWlE?oc=5"],["t","。這凸顯各國監管機構與資安標準未來勢必將自主代理行為納入合規審查。所以呢，台灣企業資安長在評估 AI 專案時，必須在明年度的資安防禦架構中納入針對 AI 軟體供應鏈的審查清單，避免外部代理工具成為攻擊跳板。"]]]},{"heading":"市場趨勢","paras":[[["t","台灣企業 AI 應用正快速從單純的「問答對話」升級為具備執行力的「自主代理」（AI Agent）架構。精誠資訊與台灣大哥大指出，AI 正從產生文字的輔助角色，轉變為能調用工具、存取資料庫與執行企業營運流程的數位員工，但這也讓風險從「說錯話」擴大為「做錯事」"],["c",1,"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/42334-systex-says-ai-agents-are-evolving-from-saying-the-wrong-things-to-doing-the-wrong-things-requiring-full-lifecycle-security-governance"],["c",3,"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/42333-taiwan-mobile-bets-on-enterprise-agentic-ai-as-myagent-connects-compute-models-and-workflows-to-drive-the-next-wave-of-growth"],["t","。例如企業若未落實身分憑證與權限隔離，雲端 Agent 憑證一旦外洩，可能在幾秒內導致線上資料庫與備份遭徹底抹除 "],["c",1,"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/42334-systex-says-ai-agents-are-evolving-from-saying-the-wrong-things-to-doing-the-wrong-things-requiring-full-lifecycle-security-governance"],["t","。為此，業界開始推動將運算基礎設施、模型平台與零信任架構整合，強調上線前測試、權限管理與全生命週期治理 "],["c",1,"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/42334-systex-says-ai-agents-are-evolving-from-saying-the-wrong-things-to-doing-the-wrong-things-requiring-full-lifecycle-security-governance"],["c",3,"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/42333-taiwan-mobile-bets-on-enterprise-agentic-ai-as-myagent-connects-compute-models-and-workflows-to-drive-the-next-wave-of-growth"],["c",14,"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE1UU2xXWW1KMWp4LUJiZWxXWXk0SEM1SU5ETm5CNmF0RGwyVXRPTkJoQjVIRHdnY05JcloxS3dRWkZlR1NiNllvODRQaW9OcVJNXzVRZnJxRkdZQnRGeG5xWGZfVUt1dzFKNnJNbXZfekFOUGkzYmhmWA?oc=5"],["t","。所以呢，企業資訊部門在導入 Agentic AI 流程時，應於下季前重新檢視 API 金鑰授權與資料庫寫入權限，採最小權限原則避免自動化操作帶來不可逆的營運損失。"]]]},{"heading":"同業動態","paras":[[["t","本週無明顯相關動作。"]]]},{"heading":"客戶動態","paras":[[["t","本週無明顯相關動作。"]]]}],"refs":[{"title":[["t","精誠資訊：AI Agent 從「說錯話」走向「做錯事」，企業資安須納入全生命週期治理"]],"link":"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/42334-systex-says-ai-agents-are-evolving-from-saying-the-wrong-things-to-doing-the-wrong-things-requiring-full-lifecycle-security-governance","source":"inside.com.tw","date":"2026-09-08","dupes":3},{"title":[["t","高通結盟亞馬遜合攻 AI 晶片，合作規模上看 600 億美元"]],"link":"https://technews.tw/2026/09/09/qualcomm-stock-surges-on-deal-to-build-custom-ai-chips-for-amazon/","source":"","date":"2026-09-09","dupes":2},{"title":[["t","台灣大押注企業 Agentic AI：MyAgent 串起算力、模型與流程，AI 事業成下一波成長引擎"]],"link":"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/42333-taiwan-mobile-bets-on-enterprise-agentic-ai-as-myagent-connects-compute-models-and-workflows-to-drive-the-next-wave-of-growth","source":"inside.com.tw","date":"2026-09-08","dupes":2},{"title":[["t","高通與 Amazon 展開多世代合作，客製 AI 推論晶片綁定最高 600 億美元採購"]],"link":"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/42347-qualcomm-amazon-custom-ai-chip-warrant-60-billion","source":"","date":"2026-09-09","dupes":1},{"title":[["t","Meta 在美推出 AI Agent「Muse」，幫你寄信、規劃行程、購物"]],"link":"https://technews.tw/2026/09/09/meta-introduces-muse/","sou